The onfhir-definitions-r4 and onfhir-definitions-r5 artifacts package HL7 FHIR
specification content:

- onfhir-definitions-r4 packages FHIR R4 (4.0.1) content, the standard
  definitions bundle (definitions-r4.json.zip) and the base CapabilityStatement
  (conformance-statement-r4.json), obtained from
  https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/definitions.json.zip
- onfhir-definitions-r5 packages FHIR R5 (5.0.0) content, the standard
  definitions bundle (definitions-r5.json.zip) and the base CapabilityStatement
  (conformance-statement-r5.json), obtained from
  https://hl7.org/fhir/R5/definitions.json.zip

